  "published": "2026-11-01T07:29:16.013Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.6.4 implements ISO 32000-2:2020 Errata Collection 3 (EC-3) fixes and PDF 2.0 conformance updates, including 1/2/4/8/16-bit /SMask and explicit /Mask unpacking, MRC mask upsampling, /OCMD /AllOff visibility, Type 3 Tz/Ts glyph matrices, empty-path clip reset, and PDF 2.0 XRef/annotation/font rules. See CHANGELOG.md.",
